# Regenerable or third-party bulk files: their URLs, sizes and SHA-256 are in raw/fetch-log.json and run.json.
# fetch_sources.py re-fetches an ignored raw file and keeps it only if it matches the logged SHA-256.
*.ve.md
*.check.json
!*.default-limit.json
**/raw/*.html
**/raw/*_djvu.txt
**/raw/refetched/
